JARVIS-PAGE-PROVENANCE v1
Every file under src/pages carries a producer marker: an emitted page names its
emitter ("Generated deterministically by frontend_codegen"), and every other page
opens with "// JARVIS-PROVENANCE: <template|ai>".
This file states the GENERATION only and carries NO COUNTS. Its absence means the
build predates FSB v1.65.0, so a validator must report that it CANNOT CLASSIFY the
page set -- never that the build is clean.
